  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WB Trust Fund: Climate adaptation through integrated land and water management (ILWAC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims at supporting African countries in meeting the challenges from climate change in land and water management. The support strateg is based on the so-called Nairobi declaration of April 2009, stating five principles for sustainable land and water management. The program aims at creating concrete results in support of the principles and by so doing have an impact on the the global World Bank programs on climate adaptation.</narrative>
  </description>
